WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
Standing heavy kick starts the Punish Counter juggle.

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.800
Ken rushes after the launching kick.

3
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.300
The running punch continues the heavy-punch follow-up.

4
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.450
Ryu falls after the Rush juggle.
